## 3. API

Base path `/api/v1`, JSON, Bearer token (JWT) for authenticated endpoints.

| # | Method | Path | Description | Success status |
|---|--------|------|-------------|----------------|
| 1 | POST | `/auth/login` | Log in, receive a token | 200 OK |
| 2 | GET | `/events?city=&date=&q=&page=` | Browse and search events | 200 OK |
| 3 | GET | `/events/{eventId}` | Event details (artist, venue, date, price tiers) | 200 OK |
| 4 | GET | `/events/{eventId}/seats?section=` | Seat map with each seat's status (available, held, sold) | 200 OK |
| 5 | POST | `/events/{eventId}/queue` | Join the waiting room for a big sale; returns a queue position and, when admitted, an access token | 202 Accepted |
| 6 | POST | `/events/{eventId}/holds` | Hold seats for 5 minutes | 201 Created |
| 7 | DELETE | `/holds/{holdId}` | Release held seats early | 204 No Content |
| 8 | POST | `/orders` | Pay for a hold and create the order (needs an `Idempotency-Key` header) | 201 Created |
| 9 | GET | `/orders/{orderId}` | View one order and its status | 200 OK |
| 10 | GET | `/me/tickets` | View my tickets | 200 OK |

### Example: hold seats

`POST /api/v1/events/42/holds`

```json
{ "seatIds": ["A-12", "A-13"] }
```

Response `201 Created`:

```json
{
  "holdId": "h_9f21c7",
  "eventId": 42,
  "seatIds": ["A-12", "A-13"],
  "expiresAt": "2026-12-01T18:05:00Z"
}
```

If any seat is already taken, nothing is held and the response is `409 Conflict`:

```json
{ "error": { "code": "SEAT_UNAVAILABLE", "message": "Seat A-13 is no longer available.", "unavailableSeatIds": ["A-13"] } }
```

### Example: pay

`POST /api/v1/orders` with header `Idempotency-Key: 6b1f...`

```json
{ "holdId": "h_9f21c7", "paymentToken": "tok_visa_123" }
```

Response `201 Created`:

```json
{ "orderId": 88123, "status": "PAID", "total": 15000, "currency": "KES", "tickets": ["A-12", "A-13"] }
```

### Errors

| Code | When |
|------|------|
| 400 | Invalid input (no seats, too many seats) |
| 401 | Missing or invalid token |
| 403 | Not admitted from the waiting room yet, or accessing someone else's order |
| 404 | Unknown event, hold or order |
| 409 | Seat already taken, or the hold has expired |
| 402 | Payment declined |
| 429 | Too many requests (rate limit) |
| 500 | Unexpected server error |

